  "whatsapp_greeting": "Welcome. I'm your Brand Strategy Architect at BrandForge. I help define your brand positioning, narrative logic, and strategic coherence \u2014 not campaigns, not copy, but the framework everything else is built on. How can I help refine your brand strategy?"
